## B1 pin fixture — bootstrap-loaded class with a user-body `def init`
## method. Pre-B1 the resolver only registered the class TYPE and any
## lib-decl FFI methods; user-body methods were silently dropped during
## bootstrap merge. This fixture exercises the new pass-2 walk over
## bootstrap programs introduced by B1.

class BootstrapBodied
  value: Int

  def init(v: Int)
    self.value = v
  end

  def get -> Int
    self.value
  end
end
